  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Sustainable Waste Management in the Caribbean - UNEP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective of the programme is to strengthen the EU-Caribbean partnership for cooperation in the field of circular economy in general and of SWM in particular and improve the resource efficiency of Caribbean economies. The specific objective of this action is to better align SWM systems in Caribbean countries with circular economy principles and National Determined Contributions and make them more able to attract investments. UNEP will specifically contribute to the achievement of the following outputs: 1.Strengthened solid waste management legal and strategic frameworks 2.Increased knowledge and capacity to deliver information-based policy action 3.Enhanced coordination and cooperation, policy dialogue, and increased awareness &lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
